firefox-addons:3114646.description:
This is a general-purpose web video downloader for standard formats such as HLS (m3u8), DASH (mpd), MP4, and WebM.
Features:
1. Download HLS videos (streaming videos indexed by m3u8 files) and combine all media segments into a single MP4 file;
2. Support for HLS live streams;
3. Support for DASH on-demand streams (streaming videos indexed by mpd files);
4. Recording: if a video or live stream player's src starts with blob and its media URL can't be detected, use Record to turn the live picture and sound or buffered video data into an MP4 file;
5. Download direct-link videos that can be played on web pages, including MP4 and WebM;
6. Support for external VTT subtitles. Subtitle files are saved alongside the video and can be used with a local media player;
7. Extract audio by choosing “Extract Audio”; downloads are provided as M4A files;
8. Multi-threaded downloads can significantly boost speed on a stable connection, especially for large files;
9. Automatically detect the resolutions available in HLS or DASH. Choose a resolution to download if the source provides multiple options;
10. Preview media images or videos. If a page contains multiple media items, use the previews to identify the one you want;
11. A feature-rich download interface lets you check speed and progress, as well as rename files;
12. Everything runs in your browser. Media data is never transferred to or converted by a third-party server.
Notes:
1. This tool works only with videos that follow technical standards. It is not compatible with videos that use non-standard playback technologies.
2. DRM- or EME-encrypted videos are not supported;
3. YouTube is not supported;
4. We are not responsible for any media you download. Please check its copyright status before downloading;
5. Although the tool supports popular web video formats, successful downloads are not guaranteed in every case. If it doesn't work for you, we apologize and recommend trying another tool.

bluejetty:00090404:ios.description:
«Мой МТС» — приложение для абонентов МТС Беларусь. Установите приложение на свой смартфон или планшет, и все данные вашего персонального счёта всегда будут у вас под рукой.
«Мой МТС» позволяет:
– подключать любое количество номеров и управлять ими;
– следить за балансом счёта;
– контролировать остатки трафика, «Открытого интернета», минут и SMS;
– просматривать историю платежей;
– узнавать актуальную информацию о рассрочке;
– просматривать расходы по номеру за последние месяцы — без заказа документов;
– подключать и отключать услуги;
– обменивать бонусные баллы в программе «МТС Бонус»;
– пополнять счёт, подключать и настраивать автоплатежи, вносить платежи по рассрочке.
Приложение доступно на белорусском и русском языках.
Мы будем благодарны вам за обратную связь и предложения — пишите нам на mymts@mts.by

